<h3><u>Bhaayi shabbir</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Bhaayi shabbir</u></strong></p>

<p>Le chala karvaan khuda hafiz,</p>

<p>(Haaye shabbir fiamanillah, chali hamsheer fiamanillah) x2</p>

<p>(Zamin ye bikhre huwe noor is behen ka salaam) x2</p>

<p>Badan darida o majboor is behen ka salaam</p>

<p>Chali hai tumse bohot door is behen ka salaam</p>

<p>Misaale fatema har dukh me muskuraungi</p>

<p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

<p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>

<ol>
 <li>salaam umme abiha ke godh ke paale,
 <p>salaam karte hai zehra ke haath ke chaale,</p>

 <p>salaam zulfe muhammed se khelne waale,</p>

 <p>(parenge durre to me sabr aazmaungi) x2</p>

 <p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

 <p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>
 </li>
 <li>Ye gham nahi hai ke me sogwaar kaydi hun,
 <p>Abu turaab ki aur fatema ki beti hun,</p>

 <p>Me is kaleje mai kuwwat ali ki rakhti hun,</p>

 <p>(Yazide waqt ke khayber ki mai garaaungi) x2</p>

 <p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

 <p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>
 </li>
 <li>Rahe wafaa ke bahattar masafiron ki kassam,
 <p>Labe farat sulagte huwe gharon ki kassam,</p>

 <p>Sina ki nok pe rakhe huwe saron ki kassam</p>

 <p>(jalaale hazrate abbas banke jaaungi) x2</p>

 <p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

 <p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>
 </li>
 <li>Khushi se ehle sitam bandha de mere bazu,
 <p>Benege nuh ka tufaan ab mere ansuu,</p>

 <p>Na chhut sakegi ye khune hussain ki khushbu,</p>

 <p>(me sar khule huwe darbaare shaam jaungi) x2</p>

 <p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

 <p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>
 </li>
 <li>Nigaah janibe dariya uthi to itna kahaa,
 <p>Mere diler alamdaar fathaye dariya</p>

 <p>tujhe khabar hai mere sarse chhingayi hai rida</p>

 <p>(tere alam ka pharera rida banaaungi) x2</p>

 <p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

 <p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>
 </li>
 <li>Jo ponchi shaam to bazaar ko sajaa dekha,
 <p>Kabhi najaf to kabhi sue karbala dekha</p>

 <p>Pukaari baba mera tumne hosla dekha</p>

 <p>(jahaa bhi jawungi farshe azaa bichaungi) x2</p>

 <p>Hussaim zindaa hai duniya ko me bataungi</p>

 <p>Bhayi shabbir fiamanilla, chali hamsheer fiamanillah</p>
 </li>
 <li>Suna hai &quot;sarwaro rehan&quot; khwahare shabbir</li>
</ol>

<p>ali ke lehje me karti ye jis ghari takreer</p>

<p>yazeedon shimr ke sine pe chalti thi shamsheer</p>

